  triage:title "prune_terminal_rows row-cap (10k) branch is untested" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr's QA-2 pass on PR #1395 (head 3b8a43fd3) reports attention_schedule_store.rs's prune_terminal_rows has no test exercising the ATTENTION_MAX_TERMINAL_ROWS (~10000) row-cap DELETE branch (only the created_at-age branch is covered). Distinct from FNX-013 (hot-path placement/indexing) -- this is a test-coverage gap on the cap logic itself. Recommendation: add a test that seeds more than 10k terminal rows and asserts the row-cap DELETE trims to the configured limit." ;
